# The owners of the sensitive paths of this repository.
#
# The handles below are placeholders. Replace every placeholder with a handle
# that belongs to a maintainer of this repository before it is published, and
# remove this comment once that has been done.
#
# The paths listed here are the sensitive ones: the tools that read the tree,
# the workflows that run on every change, the forms that ask people for
# information, and the rules themselves. A change to any of them decides what
# every other agent and every other contributor is allowed to do, so it is read
# by the owner of the path.
